### IoT API Testing
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@contentType = application/json

### Check MQTT Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/iot/status

### Get Latest Data from ESP32
GET {{baseUrl}}/iot/data/latest

### Get All Sensor Data (Last 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/iot/sensors

### Get All Power Data (Last 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/iot/power

### Get All Devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/iot/devices

### Get Activity Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/iot/logs

### ===== LED CONTROLS =====

### Turn LED1 ON
POST {{baseUrl}}/iot/control/led
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "led1": true
}

### Turn LED1 OFF
POST {{baseUrl}}/iot/control/led
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "led1": false
}

### Turn LED2 ON
POST {{baseUrl}}/iot/control/led
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "led2": true
}

### Turn LED2 OFF
POST {{baseUrl}}/iot/control/led
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "led2": false
}

### Turn Both LEDs ON
POST {{baseUrl}}/iot/control/led
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "led1": true,
  "led2": true
}

### Turn Both LEDs OFF
POST {{baseUrl}}/iot/control/led
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "led1": false,
  "led2": false
}
